<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-ANDERLECHT QUALIFY FOR BELGIAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ANDERLECHT QUALIFY FOR BELGIAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Belgian Cup semifinal return leg soccer match played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Anderlecht     3    Tielen     2</p>
<p>Anderlecht qualify 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Aalst	    3    Ekeren     3</p>
<p>(first leg 0-0. Ekeren qualifiy on away goals)</p>
</text>
